{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐2026｜《2026香港小姐競選》12位候選佳麗日前齊集廣州從化，前往當地著名地標「天人山水」進行實地取景。期間，大會特別將12位佳麗兵分兩路，安排她們參與兩種截然不同風格的活動，大展動靜皆宜的百變魅力！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">其中一組佳麗與師姐麥美恩（Mayanne）齊齊放下斯文形象，化身成「索爆漁夫」！她們無懼濕身，親自走入溪水中挑戰捉魚，全程玩得不亦樂乎，盡情展現出青春活潑、充滿活力的一面。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2e858106-43c5-4287-83de-b9e6e47f17d9.jpg-2.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20265oXP6ad0Vu1784111558.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2e858106-43c5-4287-83de-b9e6e47f17d9.jpg-2.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4afd0754-499d-4dca-9c66-c28e4e37c919.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20263rnweSmbPY1784111548.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4afd0754-499d-4dca-9c66-c28e4e37c919.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"af42278d-f47a-4bbe-93ef-d665b489b3a0.jpg-2.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026eTGbJRVznH1784111541.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"af42278d-f47a-4bbe-93ef-d665b489b3a0.jpg-2.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5528b596-1904-4f7b-970e-d4f89ce31e7d.jpg-2.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026xpcR3Mpqqt1784111534.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5528b596-1904-4f7b-970e-d4f89ce31e7d.jpg-2.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">至於另一組佳麗則走向優雅路線，出發前往色彩繽紛的花田。她們在盛開的花海中擺出各款優美姿勢，拍下一系列仙氣十足的唯美靚相，畫面極之賞心悅目。兩組行程各有千秋，將佳麗們動靜皆宜的魅力發揮得淋漓盡致，令人更加期待她們在未來環節中的表現！</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"57cbbb78-dd87-49e9-839b-745846b4410e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20266gi92OALu71784111595.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"57cbbb78-dd87-49e9-839b-745846b4410e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">12位佳麗分別是1號袁絲珩Bernice、2號李澤欣Scarlett、3號李澄晴Chorie、4號譚雅文Tiffany、5號魏欣Etherine、6號盧蔚晴Jasmine、7號楊媛媛Vera、8號鄧匡閔Ada、9號周芳姿Gracia、10號陳梓穎Cecilia、11號顏懿菲Agnes及12號湯家琳Caris。</span><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-19T09:18:12.127984+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":465,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}